      "@value": "Affected versions of FortiWeb contain insufficient input sanitization, allowing for an attacker to use SQL injection to write a malicious .pth file to the into FortiWeb's site-packages Python directory. This allows the malicious code to execute using the privileges granted to Python scripts in that high-level directory."
     }
