     {
      "@value": "CVE-2024-4947 is a type confusion vulnerability in Chrome's V8 JavaScript engine.\n\nAdversaries have been observed exploiting this vulnerability by hosting a web-based game on a site that triggered the vulnerability and executed arbitrary code. \n\nAdversaries promoted the game on social media and through emails."
     }
    ],
